{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Myosotis</i> is a narrative-driven, linear experience that follows the story of Frank Miller, an elderly man living alone after the loss of his wife, Judie. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as an ordinary life quickly unravels into something far stranger. Days slip by with small, almost unnoticeable changes\u2026 and nights bring shadows that refuse to stay buried.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frank Miller once lived a simple, quiet life with his wife Judie. After her passing, he spends his days going through familiar routines, visited now and then by his only daughter, Ellie, and her unfamiliar husband, Nick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.<br>The house doesn\u2019t feel the same.<br>The nights grow heavier, haunted by echoes of Judie that creep through the halls. Conversations change. Rooms feel unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, you begin to question what\u2019s real, what\u2019s memory\u2026 and what\u2019s slipping away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras/e29d80e140adfc3c477cb3d55cc76cfd.poster.avif?t=1760379459\" width=424 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras/e29d80e140adfc3c477cb3d55cc76cfd.webm?t=1760379459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras/e29d80e140adfc3c477cb3d55cc76cfd.mp4?t=1760379459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Myosotis</i> focuses on immersive, atmospheric storytelling. The experience is driven by exploration, dialogue, and interactive moments that bring Frank\u2019s life to the forefront.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person perspective:</strong> See the world through Frank\u2019s eyes as it gradually changes around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive environments:</strong> Small details tell the story\u2014photographs, letters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative progression:</strong> Conversations and events guide you through an intimate, personal journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be experienced at a deliberate pace, pulling you deeper into Frank\u2019s world one day\u2014and one night\u2014at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras/2bdba7f629c70b7c94aa897162e2537f.avif?t=1760379459\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras_big/2bdba7f629c70b7c94aa897162e2537f.avif?t=1760379459 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply emotional, story-rich experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric world that shifts in subtle, unsettling ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear narrative focused on love, loss, and the human condition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal HUD, no distractions\u2014just you and the story.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3977140?t=1760379459","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/5b21fa8884695854007e9dcd428d8590e1700aac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760379459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/dfb98099d84a01d816e8808fcd66c12fdfff6aaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760379459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/dfb98099d84a01d816e8808fcd66c12fdfff6aaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760379459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4092010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Myosotis</i> is a narrative-driven, linear experience that follows the story of Frank Miller, an elderly man living alone after the loss of his wife, Judie. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as an ordinary life quickly unravels into something far stranger. Days slip by with small, almost unnoticeable changes\u2026 and nights bring shadows that refuse to stay buried.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frank Miller once lived a simple, quiet life with his wife Judie. After her passing, he spends his days going through familiar routines, visited now and then by his only daughter, Ellie, and her unfamiliar husband, Nick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.<br>The house doesn\u2019t feel the same.<br>The nights grow heavier, haunted by echoes of Judie that creep through the halls. Conversations change. Rooms feel unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, you begin to question what\u2019s real, what\u2019s memory\u2026 and what\u2019s slipping away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras/e29d80e140adfc3c477cb3d55cc76cfd.poster.avif?t=1760379459\" width=424 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras/e29d80e140adfc3c477cb3d55cc76cfd.webm?t=1760379459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras/e29d80e140adfc3c477cb3d55cc76cfd.mp4?t=1760379459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Myosotis</i> focuses on immersive, atmospheric storytelling. The experience is driven by exploration, dialogue, and interactive moments that bring Frank\u2019s life to the forefront.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person perspective:</strong> See the world through Frank\u2019s eyes as it gradually changes around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive environments:</strong> Small details tell the story\u2014photographs, letters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative progression:</strong> Conversations and events guide you through an intimate, personal journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be experienced at a deliberate pace, pulling you deeper into Frank\u2019s world one day\u2014and one night\u2014at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras/2bdba7f629c70b7c94aa897162e2537f.avif?t=1760379459\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/extras_big/2bdba7f629c70b7c94aa897162e2537f.avif?t=1760379459 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply emotional, story-rich experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric world that shifts in subtle, unsettling ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear narrative focused on love, loss, and the human condition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal HUD, no distractions\u2014just you and the story.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Matthew"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977140/53d60d5bdfac086430fae40c10d19fc25eb78841/header.jpg?t=1760379459","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3977140/575547652/9d2c897aff3951ecad655050fef170daa4a995a6/1756325638/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756327697","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3977140/575547652/9d2c897aff3951ecad655050fef170daa4a995a6/1756325638/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756327697","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3977140/575547652/9d2c897aff3951ecad655050fef170daa4a995a6/1756325638/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756327697","id":257189873,"name":"Myosotis Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189873/f99c7919c9fdd227852b8ba96b82f5f62e46c184/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756327697"}],"name":"Myosotis","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-6350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 Ti, 2 GB | AMD Radeon R7 360, 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670 | AMD Ryzen5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660Ti 6GB